          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Às vezes, queremos estilizar apenas uma pequena parte de uma página. Apenas algumas palavras em um HUD de jogo. Faremos isso com a tag <code>&lt;span&gt;</code>.</p><p>Abaixo está um exemplo de HUD que contém palavras estilizadas dentro de itens de lista.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   span {&#xA;    color: #0078E6;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .stat {&#xA;    color: #6D3ACF;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Mini Game HUD&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;   &lt;li&gt;Player: &lt;span&gt;Ranger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;   &lt;li&gt;Level: &lt;span&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;   &lt;li&gt;Status: &lt;span style=&quot;color: #A8561E;&quot;&gt;Poisoned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;   &lt;li&gt;Score: &lt;span class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;1250&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;   &lt;li&gt;Gold: &lt;span class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O elemento <code>&lt;span&gt;</code> é usado para aplicar estilos a partes do texto.</p><p>Vamos usar a tag <code>&lt;span&gt;</code> para fazer o texto <code>Poisoned</code> aparecer diferente do restante do texto.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"190\" endIndex=\"196\" /><option startIndex=\"204\" endIndex=\"211\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Mini Game HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><tex